Vendored from https://github.com/vinceliuice/Orchis-kde at commit
b2a96919eee40264e79db402b915f926436100ad (2025-10-18), plasma/desktoptheme/Orchis-dark.

Local change: scripts/recolor-orchis.py repaints the hard-coded dark fills of
panel, popup, tooltip and widget backgrounds with ArtixDarkRounded's Window
background (#05070a), keeping Orchis's opacity; shadows and blur masks are
unchanged. The colour is literal on purpose: currentColor turned notification
popups light grey. Re-run the script after re-vendoring or changing the
scheme's Window background:

    scripts/recolor-orchis.py kde/desktoptheme/Orchis-dark \
        --scheme kde/color-schemes/ArtixDarkRounded.colors --write
